# Copy to .env (or set in the Netlify build environment) and fill in.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Analytics (optional, cookie-free — no consent banner required)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# src/assets/components/Analytics.jsx injects
#   <script defer data-domain="paulobraga-realestate.pt" src="$VITE_ANALYTICS_SRC">
# only when this variable is set. Leave it unset and no script is loaded at all.
#
# Two cookie-free options that both accept the data-domain attribute:
#
#   Umami Cloud (free tier, EU-hosted, GDPR-friendly):
#     VITE_ANALYTICS_SRC=https://cloud.umami.is/script.js
#     (Umami also needs data-website-id — add it in Analytics.jsx if you pick Umami.)
#
#   Plausible (paid, EU-hosted, no cookies):
#     VITE_ANALYTICS_SRC=https://plausible.io/js/script.js
#
# VITE_ANALYTICS_SRC=
